ear as charged orange and pale yellow crystalline pixel blocks, touching the ground to form concentric circular pixel waves. Each voxel glows with internal LED-like illumination, creating a frontal view of an 8-bit halo. Angular shapes float against a retro-futuristic cosmic backdrop, with emerald binary streams pulsating against a bright background.\n\nOrange and atomic pale pink sparkling art particles swirl around the structure, their cubic forms dissolving into ASCII sparkles. The background features an embedded network landscape, with a holographic diamond pattern in gradient pale yellow overlaid on a semi-transparent wireframe mesh, shifting between neon pink and laser yellow. Chrome-edged blocks cast dynamic isometric shadows, outlined in glowing pale yellow, while liquid pixels drip rainbow trails, symbolizing real-time AI construction.\n\nThe background draws from iconic scenes of *Tron: Legacy*'s digital sci-fi world, with cascading gradient pixel rain from above. The overall tone is bright, with playful lighting that enhances depth without losing the iconic blocky Minecraft DNA—blending retro gaming nostalgia with the cosmic rave energy of AI-generated worlds. The visual effect is bright and light-hearted, with a refreshing and healing tone, a simple background, and a strong sci-fi feel."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 332, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "type": "JjkShowText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [286.5375061035156, 522.9937133789062], "pos": [4726.9482421875, 1490.8179931640625], "id": 210, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "JjkShowText"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "translation", "links": [332], "label": "translation", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "translation"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["卡通像素风格的充满活力的象征，带有Minecraft和电影tron legacy经典元素，充满了科幻霓虹灯的能量。字母前视图“TRON”以带电荷的橙色和淡黄色晶体像素块的形式出现，接触的地面形成一圈一圈圆形像素波浪，每个体素通过内部类似LED的照明发光，形成一个8位光晕的正视图。棱角分明的形状漂浮在复古未来主义的宇宙背景中，祖母绿的二元流在亮色背景中脉动。橙色和原子淡粉色闪光艺术粒子围绕结构运行，它们的立方体形式溶解成ASCII闪光。背景以嵌入式网络景观为特色，渐变淡黄色中的全息钻石图案覆盖着半透明的线框网格，在霓虹粉和激光黄之间切换。Chrome边缘的块投射出动态等距阴影，呈现为发光的浅黄色轮廓，而液体像素则滴落彩虹轨迹，这意味着实时AI构建。背景是tron legacy经典画面电子世界科幻场景，从天而降的渐变像素雨整体色调明亮，俏皮的灯光在不失去标志性的块状Minecraft DNA的情况下增强了深度，将复古游戏怀旧与人工智能产生的宇宙狂欢能量融为一体。明亮而轻松的视觉效果。整体色调清新，具有治愈力，背景简单，科幻感强", 904, "randomize"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_Translator", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [439.5038757324219, 441.7437438964844], "pos": [4275.609375, 1567.0101318359375], "id": 211, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "RH_Translator"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [259, 318], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["InSaNe_Detail_FLUX-000001.safetensors", 0.45000000000000007], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 257, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [488.12615966796875, 82], "pos": [3758.140869140625, 1585.3306884765625], "id": 161, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "order": 8}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-1877.759504530165, -628.5529106987848], "scale": 0.45}, "info": {"software": "ComfyUI", "author": "", "created": "2024-11-27T15:24:38.648Z", "name": "workflow", "description": "", "modified": "2024-11-27T15:24:38.648Z", "version": "1"}}, "groups": [{"color": "#a1309b", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "文生图模块", "bounding": [3743.820556640625, 1368.6856689453125, 2097.852294921875, 665.0756225585938]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "SD放大模块", "bounding": [3740, 2076.39990234375, 1645.4140625, 807.5999755859375]}], "links": [[256, 164, 0, 160, 0, "CLIP"], [257, 165, 0, 161, 0, "MODEL"], [258, 1